# Solana RPC endpoint used in production. Without this, the app falls back to
# a public RPC (solana-rpc.publicnode.com) which can be slow/rate-limited.
# Get a free/paid endpoint from Helius, QuickNode, Alchemy, etc.
VITE_SOLANA_RPC_URL=

# Optional: proxy path used only when running on localhost during development.
# VITE_SOLANA_RPC_PROXY_URL=/api/rpc
